  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "claim_5cb4be86dd1949239a6adbf8469b0fd0",
      "statement": "The project exposes three lifecycle npm scripts: `dev` runs `bun --hot src/index.ts`, `build` runs `bun build ./src/index.html --outdir=dist --sourcemap --target=browser --minify --define:process.env.NODE_ENV='\"production\"' --env='BUN_PUBLIC_*'`, and `start` runs `NODE_ENV=production bun src/index.ts`.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://package.json#L6-L10",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:937e4613e1fcd7c14ca9406d5f3b47bef180d3dc289ef1ef39d9def2c59e6d7a:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_ae0b8ed7042c4eb3b68914784f95c301",
      "statement": "The production server entry point is `src/index.ts`, which imports `src/index.html`, mounts the Elysia API under `/api/*`, and serves the HTML shell for all other paths via `Bun.serve`.",
