      "statement": "The production build emits browser assets to `dist/`, `tsconfig.json` excludes `dist` from type checking, and both the build flag `--env='BUN_PUBLIC_*'` and `bunfig.toml` restrict exposed environment variables to those prefixed with `BUN_PUBLIC_`.",
